# Which Way Home Economics? An Examination of the Conceptual Orientation of Home Economics Curricula.

**Authors:** Grundy, Shirley, Henry, Margaret

## Abstract
Identifies and characterizes a set of conceptual frameworks that traditionally have informed home economics curricula. Proposes an emancipatory orientation towards home economics that emphasizes enlightenment and empowering the students. Uses critical theory to frame questions regarding food, shelter, clothing, physical and psychological needs. (MJP)

